## 構文の色と診断
size 20x6 cursor 3,0
   |func f() {          |
fg |kkkk................|
fx |  ~~~~~             |
   |        // note     |
fg |........ccccccc.....|
fx |           ____     |
   |        return "s"  |
fg |........kkkkkk.sss..|
fx |_________         _ |
   |}                   |
   | NORMAL  [ 4,1  All |
fx |SSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSS|
   |                    |

## 選択を重ねる
size 20x6 cursor 0,9
   |func f() {          |
fg |kkkk................|
fx |  vvvvvvv           |
   |        // note     |
fg |........ccccccc.....|
   |        return "s"  |
fg |........kkkkkk.sss..|
   |}                   |
   | VISUAL   1,10  All |
fx |SSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSS|
   |                    |
